            "id": "4970827",
            "title": "What Moved Markets This Week",
            "description": "<html><body><div class=\"wsb_wrapper\"> <div class=\"wsb_main\"><span><p data-eci=\"true\"><strong>Listen on the go! A daily podcast of Wall Street Breakfast will be available by 8:00 a.m. on <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/author/wall-street-breakfast?utm_source=newsletter&amp;utm_medium=toptext&amp;utm_campaign=wsbpodpromo\">Seeking Alpha</a>, <a href=\"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/wall-street-breakfast/id1358381502\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">iTunes</a>, <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/show/05uLjJxkVgQsRk8LWLCLpx\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Spotify</a>.</strong></p></span></div> <figure class=\"getty-figure\" data-type=\"getty-image\"><picture><img alt=\"\" data-id=\"516545268\" data-type=\"getty-image\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"auto\" src=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/516545268/image_516545268.jpg?io=getty-c-w630\" width=\"100%\"/><figcaption><p class=\"item-credits\">rocksunderwater/iStock via Getty Images</p></figcaption></picture></figure>\n<p class=\"wsb_bold\" data-skip-content-styles=\"\"></p> <p><span class=\"b italic\" style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;\">Up for a challenge? Test your knowledge on the biggest events in the investing world over the past week. Take the latest <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/quiz/78-investment-news-quiz-friday-nov-20-2026-11-20\">Seeking Alpha News Quiz</a> and see how you stack up against the competition.</span></p> <p></p> <h2></h2> <p></p> <p><br/>Wall Street’s major averages finished the week deep in the red as the S&amp;P 500 entered correction territory, all while investors digested Anthropic’s landmark IPO and closely monitored Nvidia’s latest earnings report.<br/><br/>The S&amp;P 500 (<a class=\"ticker-link\" href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/SP500\">SP500</a>) officially entered <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4675255-sp-500-enters-correction-territory-and-these-20-names-are-fueling-the-leg-lower\" target=\"_blank\">correction territory</a> on Friday, as it now declined over 10% from the all-time highs it reached back in October amid mounting market pressures around AI.<br/><br/>Anthropic (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/ANT\" title=\"Anthropic, PBC\">ANT</a>) made history on Thursday as it became the first pure-play AI lab to secure a <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4674744-anthropic-ascends-into-history-with-ipo-shares-hit-nasdaq-at-11150\" target=\"_blank\">public listing</a> on the Nasdaq. Shares opened strongly at $111.50, marking a high-profile debut for the company behind the Claude AI models.<br/><br/>On the earnings front, chip giant Nvidia (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/NVDA\" title=\"NVIDIA Corporation\">NVDA</a>) <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4673924-nvidia-non-gaap-eps-of-2_68-beats-by-0_21-revenue-of-115_85b-beats-by-7_14b\" target=\"_blank\">reported</a> non-GAAP earnings per share of $2.68, beating analyst expectations by $0.21, while revenue came in at $115.84B, surpassing forecasts by a substantial $7.13B.<br/><br/>For the week, the blue-chip Dow (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/DJI\" title=\"Dow Jones Industrial Average Index\">DJI</a>) tumbled <span class=\"red\" style=\"color: #ff0000;\">-8.02%</span>, the benchmark S&amp;P (<a class=\"ticker-link\" href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/SP500\">SP500</a>) dropped <span class=\"red\" style=\"color: #ff0000;\">-8.61%</span>, and the tech-heavy Nasdaq Composite (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/COMP:IND\" title=\"NASDAQ Composite Index\">COMP:IND</a>) plunged <span class=\"red\" style=\"color: #ff0000;\">-10.02%</span>. Read a preview of next week's major events in <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4675220-catalyst-watch-spotlight-on-the-ai-trade-core-pce-and-black-friday-traffic\" target=\"_blank\">Seeking Alpha's Catalyst Watch.</a><br/><br/><a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4675220-catalyst-watch-spotlight-on-the-ai-trade-core-pce-and-black-friday-traffic\" target=\"_blank\"></a></p> <p></p> <h2><a class=\"!no-underline !text-share-text\" href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4675112-as-manufacturing-labor-shortages-persist-robots-help-fill-the-gap\">Domo arigato</a></h2> <p>U.S. companies are installing more robots in their factories and warehouses to help offset rising costs and labor shortages. Several industries saw substantial increases in robot orders during Q3, from automotive and semiconductors to life sciences. As manufacturers struggle to recruit and retain talent, robots can help fill the gap. <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4675112-as-manufacturing-labor-shortages-persist-robots-help-fill-the-gap\"><span class=\"b\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Read more.</span></a></p> <p class=\"wsb_bold\" data-skip-content-styles=\"\">Seeking Alpha's Calls Of The Week</p> <p>Strong Buy: Nebius’ (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/NBIS\" title=\"Nebius Group N.V.\">NBIS</a>) Selloff <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4969763-nebius-the-selloff-went-too-far-rating-upgrade\">Has Gone Too Far</a>.<br/><br/>This Is A <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4969776-this-is-a-dream-entry-point-for-netflix-stock-rating-upgrade\">Dream Entry Point</a> For Netflix (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/NFLX\" title=\"Netflix, Inc.\">NFLX</a>) Stock.<br/><br/>BP (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/BP\" title=\"BP p.l.c.\">BP</a>): One Quarter And Market <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4970282-bp-one-quarter-and-market-forgets-past-speculative-rating-upgrade\">Forgets The Past</a>.<br/><br/><a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/AGNCP\" title=\"AGNC Investment Corp. 6.12 DP SH PFD F\">AGNCP</a> Dividend Yield Faces Off <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4969789-9-6-percent-dividend-yield-from-agncp-faces-off-against-3-peers\">Against Three Peers</a>.<br/><br/>Whirlpool's (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/WHR\" title=\"Whirlpool Corpora